OL,3,GNEWSAMineshaft halts major dump
OL,4,Aclearance after one day
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to clear an illegal waste dump
OL,7,Fground to a halt on the first day after
OL,8,Fa coal mine was discovered under the
OL,9,Fsite.
OL,11,FWigan Council said efforts to remove
OL,12,Fthe 18,000-tonne pile near Bickershaw,
OL,13,FWigan, had been stopped because of
OL,14,F"historical mineshafts on site that
OL,15,Fcould cause a risk with repeated heavy
OL,16,Florry loads".
OL,18,FTonnes of rubbish had been building up
OL,19,Fat the site on Bolton House Road since
OL,20,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
